{"E:\\videos\\helen4\\wt\\vlog\\helen4\\voz\\b000_t2.wav": {"text": "Never boil your beans in plain water again. Every Friday morning there is a line out my door, and they are all waiting for the same thing, a two-dollar smoked ham hock. Last month a man named Earl was standing right where you are, with eight cans of beans in his cart from the big store. $10.32, he said. Helen, I cooked them in a pot of water, and they taste like the can, like nothing. I put one pound of dry navy beans on my counter, $1.69, and one smoked ham hock, $2. I told him, Earl, that is more beans than your eight cans and it is going to taste like your grandmother made it. He came back the next Friday and stood in line with everybody else. Today I am going to show you exactly what I told Earl. So your beans come out creamy, never hard, never mushy and full of flavor for about $4 a pot.", "words": [{"w": " Never", "s": 0.04, "e": 0.5}, {"w": " boil", "s": 0.5, "e": 0.96}, {"w": " your", "s": 0.96, "e": 1.2}, {"w": " beans", "s": 1.2, "e": 1.62}, {"w": " in", "s": 1.62, "e": 1.88}, {"w": " plain", "s": 1.88, "e": 2.26}, {"w": " water", "s": 2.26, "e": 2.64}, {"w": " again.", "s": 2.64, "e": 3.9}, {"w": " Every", "s": 3.9, "e": 4.02}, {"w": " Friday", "s": 4.02, "e": 4.52}, {"w": " morning", "s": 4.52, "e": 5.04}, {"w": " there", "s": 5.04, "e": 5.38}, {"w": " is", "s": 5.38, "e": 5.6}, {"w": " a", "s": 5.6, "e": 5.78}, {"w": " line", "s": 5.78, "e": 6.04}, {"w": " out", "s": 6.04, "e": 6.26}, {"w": " my", "s": 6.26, "e": 6.52}, {"w": " door,", "s": 6.52, "e": 7.46}, {"w": " and", "s": 7.46, "e": 7.52}, {"w": " they", "s": 7.52, "e": 7.72}, {"w": " are", "s": 7.72, "e": 7.88}, {"w": " all", "s": 7.88, "e": 8.2}, {"w": " waiting", "s": 8.2, "e": 8.58}, {"w": " for", "s": 8.58, "e": 8.84}, {"w": " the", "s": 8.84, "e": 8.98}, {"w": " same", "s": 8.98, "e": 9.32}, {"w": " thing,", "s": 9.32, "e": 9.82}, {"w": " a", "s": 9.82, "e": 10.42}, {"w": " two-dollar", "s": 10.42, "e": 11.08}, {"w": " smoke